                "remarks": "The system owner defines who may reach which target in the authorization server and issues tunnel tokens accordingly."
              },
              {
                "uuid": "f8b06543-0f52-4c0a-bde6-fd7a876a7122",
                "control-id": "ac-4",
                "description": "Egress is limited to the configured IP prefixes. Loopback, link-local, cloud metadata, multicast, unspecified and broadcast addresses are always denied, even inside an allowed prefix. Targets are IP literals, so no name resolution can change where a tunnel goes, and the dialer checks the address again at connect time.",
                "props": [
                  {
