                "control-id": "au-2",
                "description": "The relay logs these events: tunnel opened, tunnel closed with its reason, tunnel refused with its reason, connection refused at the per-source limit, certificate reloaded or failed to reload, relay started, stopping and shutdown timeout, and a recovered panic.",
