                "description": "Tunnel records carry the time, the event, the source address and port, the subject, the authorization server's session, the first 8 hexadecimal digits of the token's SHA-256, the target, the protocol, and the outcome: bytes in each direction, duration and close reason, or the status and reason of a refusal.",
