                "control-id": "cm-7",
                "description": "The relay does one thing: it serves HTTP CONNECT to IP targets. It refuses every other method, extended CONNECT and WebSocket, has no administrative interface, and ships as a static binary in a distroless image without a shell, running as a non-root user with every capability dropped and a read-only root filesystem.",
