                "control-id": "ia-9",
                "description": "The relay authenticates to the authorization server with private_key_jwt (RFC 7523), using a key registered by RFC 7591 dynamic registration. It authenticates the server through TLS 1.3, requires the metadata's issuer to equal the configured issuer (RFC 8414), and refuses non-HTTPS endpoints.",
