                "control-id": "sc-7",
                "description": "The relay is the managed interface between untrusted clients and the private network: it accepts only authorized tunnels to allowed prefixes and denies special-purpose addresses. The chart's NetworkPolicy admits only the relay port and allows egress only to the authorization server, the allowed prefixes and DNS.",
                "props": [
